Design a 4-stage shift register that captures 4 bits of input data on the rising edge of the clock. The first stage stores the input data, and each subsequent stage shifts the data through the pipeline. The output provides the data from the last stage of the register, effectively implementing a delay of 3 clock cycles for the input data before it is available at the output.
