description:
Design a Schmitt trigger circuit that provides a stable output based on the threshold levels of the input signal. When the input exceeds the defined high threshold, the output is set to HIGH; conversely, if the input falls below the low threshold, the output is set to LOW. This functionality helps to eliminate noise and provides hysteresis in the signal, ensuring that the output changes state only when the input crosses the specified thresholds.
module top_module(
  input in,
  output out
);

