description:
Design a circuit that computes the even parity bit for an 8-bit input. The module takes an 8-bit input vector and outputs a single bit that indicates whether the total number of 1s in the input is even. When the input changes, the module invokes a task to perform an XOR operation across all bits of the input, with the output assigned to indicate even parity.
module top_module(
    input [7:0] x,
    output reg z
    );

code:
module top_module(
    input [7:0] x,
    output reg z
    );task calc_even_parity;
        input [7:0] x;
        output z;
        begin
            z = x[7]^x[6]^x[5]^x[4]^x[3]^x[2]^x[1]^x[0];
        end
    endtask
    always
        @ (x)
        begin
            calc_even_parity(x,z);
        end

endmodule

